Fixing Mistakes
Case 1:     staged changes
                        git reset <- file name
                        git reset

Case 2:     commited changes (for one commit)
                        git reset HEAD~1   // head matlb hota hai hamra last commit ko point ko

Case 3:     commited changes (for many commits)
                        git reset <- commit hash ->
                        git reset --hard <- commit hash


Note : agr haam (git lock)  likh se to jitne bhi hamn commit kiye hai wo sare ke a jayenge ya dikh jayenge 


 